string not only from its rear but also from its mouth. It’s hard to tell which end is which."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"A single strand of a special string is endlessly spun out of its rear. The string leads back to its nest."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il attache un fil à sa proie avant de la libérer. Il s’en servira pour la retrouver, elle et ses amis."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il attache un fil à sa proie avant de la libérer. Il s’en servira pour la retrouver, elle et ses amis."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il peut produire des fils de soie par l’arrière-train ou par la bouche. Il est difficile de différencier les deux."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Teje su telaraña desde atrás y desde su boca. Es muy difícil saber dónde está cada cual."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It spins string not only from its rear but also from its mouth. It’s hard to tell which end is which."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"お尻からだけでなく 口からも 糸を 出すので 見ただけでは どっちが 頭か わからない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il attache un fil à sa proie avant de la libérer. Il s’en servira pour la retrouver, elle et ses amis."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Pega hilos de seda a sus presas y las libera para seguirlas más tarde y localizar también a sus amigos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"獲物の 体に 糸を つけて わざと 逃がす。糸を たどれば 仲間ごと 捕まえられるからだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"À l’extrémité des pattes de Migalos, on trouve de petits crochets qui lui permettent de cavaler sur les surfaces verticales et au plafond. Ce Pokémon peut piéger ses ennemis dans sa solide toile de soie."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ariados tiene unas patas con forma de garfio que le permiten correr por techos y superficies verticales. Este Pokémon oprime al rival con una tela de araña fina y resistente."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ariados’s feet are tipped with tiny hooked claws that enable it to scuttle on ceilings and vertical walls. This Pokémon constricts the foe with thin and strong silk webbing."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"足の 先端には 小さな カギヅメが あり 天井や 垂直の 壁も 歩ける。 細く 丈夫な 糸で 敵を 絞めあげる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"À l’extrémité des pattes de Migalos, on trouve de petits crochets qui lui permettent de cavaler sur les surfaces verticales et au plafond. Ce Pokémon peut piéger ses ennemis dans sa solide toile de soie."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ariados tiene unas patas con forma de garfio que le permiten correr por techos y superficies verticales. Este Pokémon oprime al rival con una tela de araña fina y resistente."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ariados’s feet are tipped with tiny hooked claws that enable it to scuttle on ceilings and vertical walls. This Pokémon constricts the foe with thin and strong silk webbing."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"足の 先端には 小さな カギヅメが あり 天井や 垂直の 壁も 歩ける。 細く 丈夫な 糸で 敵を 絞めあげる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Dans certaines régions, on utilise le fil de Migalos pour tisser des étoffes. Leur grande solidité les rend très populaires."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"En ciertas regiones, se utiliza la telaraña de Ariados para tejer. La tela tejida con este hilo tiene fama de ser muy resistente."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"There are some areas where people use the string Ariados spins for their own weaving. The resulting cloth is popular for its strength."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"アリアドスの 糸を 使って 機を 織る 地域も ある。 丈夫な 布で 好評だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ce Pokémon peut créer du fil avec sa bouche ou son abdomen. Il l’utilise pour ligoter sa proie, puis aspire lentement ses fluides vitaux."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Teje su telaraña con el abdomen o la boca. Inmoviliza a sus presas con su hilo y se alimenta lentamente de sus fluidos corporales."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It spins thread from both its rear and its mouth. Then it wraps its prey up in thread and sips their bodily fluids at its leisure."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"尻からも 口からも 糸をだす。 糸で 獲物を 絡め取り ゆっくりと 体液を すする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il erre chaque nuit à la recherche d’une proie. Quand il en trouve une, il l’immobilise grâce à ses fils, puis la croque avec ses mandibules."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ronda por la noche en busca de presas a las que inmoviliza con su hilo para luego clavarles los colmillos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Every night, it wanders around in search of prey, whose movements it restrains by spewing threads before it bites into them with its fangs."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"夜ごと 獲物を 求めて さ迷う。 見つけた 獲物に 糸を 吐き 身動きを 封じて キバで かじる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il capture ses proies en projetant un fil qu’il sécrète. À la nuit tombée, il quitte sa toile et part chasser activement."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Captura a sus presas con el hilo que segrega. Al caer la noche, abandona su tela y sale a cazar activamente."},{"la